# B9 (BallLockedInBrig 0x424210): a lock that does not start mode 13 feeds the next ball: the plunger gets 0x3fb
# (PlungerRelaunchBall) with 0.96 s, so MultiballCount drops to 0 at the capture and is back at 1 once the relaunch has run.
# Mode forced to 2 by poke. Capture at frame 210; the relaunch is due 96 frames (0.96 s) later, i.e. around frame 306.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 poke info_text_box message_field 2
200 expect multiball == 1
210 event s_hole19 ControlBallCaptured
210 expect locked == 1
210 expect multiball == 0
290 expect multiball == 0
305 expect multiball == 1
305 expect locked == 1
305 expect mode == 2
320 quit
